  "description": "Lanian, clash with the world once more!\n\nOnly your magic will bring this war to an end.\n\nMy friend died, and my master died.\n\nThe villagers lost their lives for no reason.\n\nThe war took everything away, leaving nothing behind.\n\nBut life itself is an adventure.\n\nYou cannot end the war without stepping into the heart of its whirlwind.\n\nLanian—the name born from my adventure, the name I will call out until the day I die!",
